## 7. Deterministic Heuristic Fallback Scanner

### File: [`backend/agents/cleaning_node.py`](file:///c:/Auto_BI/backend/agents/cleaning_node.py) — `generate_heuristic_cleaning_ops()` (Lines 170–298)

**Trigger**: Activated when LLM strategy returns 0 valid operations OR fails entirely.

**Rules Applied** (in order per column):

| Rule # | Condition | Operation Generated |
|--------|-----------|---------------------|
| 0 | Always | `deduplicate` on `"all"` columns |
| 1 | `null_pct > 0.50` and not identifier | `drop_column` |
| 2 | Column name contains `"name"` / `"customer"` | `fill_null` → `"Unknown Customer"` |
| 2b | Column name contains `"email"` | `fill_null` → `null_invalid_email` |
| 2c | Column name contains `"phone"` / `"contact"` | `fill_null` → `"Unspecified"` |
| 3 | Column looks like date (name or samples contain `"date"`, `"time"`, `"202"`, `"/"`) | `parse_date` |
| 4 | Numeric-looking column stored as VARCHAR (age, amount, price, rating, qty) | `cast_type` → `safe_numeric_cast` |
| 5 | Categorical column (gender, status, country, method, category) | `normalize` → `normalize_categorical` |
| 5b | Any other VARCHAR column | `trim_whitespace` |
| 6 | `null_pct > 0` and numeric dtype | `fill_null` → `median` |
| 6b | `null_pct > 0` and text/categorical dtype | `fill_null` → `mode` |

This ensures **60+ cleaning operations** are generated deterministically even without LLM involvement.

